OL,3,GNEWSATo the day I die, I will regret
OL,4,Aputting a cigarette in my mouth
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To the day I die, I will regret
OL,7,Fputting a cigarette in my mouth".
OL,9,FThese are the words of Joan McConville,
OL,10,Fwho was first diagnosed with lung
OL,11,Fcancer in 2023.
OL,13,FThe former teacher believes her cancer
OL,14,Fmay have been caught earlier if
OL,15,Fscreening had been available in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,18,FDespite growing evidence that early
OL,19,Fdetection can significantly reduce
OL,20,Fdeath rates, Northern Ireland has yet
OL,21,Fto fund a targeted lung cancer
OL,22,Fscreening programme.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
